  "question": {
    "text": "If \\(y=\\log ^n x\\), where \\(\\log ^n\\) means \\(\\log _e \\log _e \\log _e \\ldots\\) (repeated \\(n\\) times), then \\(x \\log x \\log ^2 x \\log ^3 x \\ldots . . \\log ^{n-1} x \\log ^n x \\frac{d y}{d x}\\) is equal to",
